  "description": "Lee Pyeong-Hwa has three things: a stunning face inherited from his famous mother, three different surnames thanks to her endless marriages, and a desperate need to survive after running away. Hiding his true secondary gender, he gets by working date-for-hire gigs as a beta. But when he accepts a request from an enigmatic client, Pyeong-Hwa finds himself face-to-face with Lee Tae-Gang, his soon-to-be stepbrother. Instantly exposed, he is dragged into a tangled web of undeniable chemistry and an unsettling, taboo connection. Bound by a secret he can no longer hide, Pyeong-Hwa is drawn deeper into a dangerous game of deception and desire. Is this ill-timed encounter a cruel twist of fate, or the beginning of an inevitable destiny?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
